      "side": 1,
      "message": "We have a `test_mockable_static_inline` keyword that changes between `static inline` (normal use) and `__attribute__((weak))` while testing. (`include/common.h`, lines 296 and 314). Would that work here instead of the #if..#else?",
      "revId": "1c88a6e6480d84dee4dda607b043676d1ea6eab9",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
